WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From a squat, plant the hands shoulder-width and lift the hips.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Place the backs of the thighs high on the upper arms.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Lean forward, engage the core, and lift one foot, then the other.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Cross the ankles and round slightly to stay balanced.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then uncross and step or jump lightly back.
